  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until caramelized, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the chopped branston pickle and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
